      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-21T14:34:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to echo what everyone else has said. I use the EE box and all the cards fit in tightly. So tightly that it is difficult to take out. There is absolutely no room for an extra deck or the tokens. My solution probably won't help. I got an extra set of tokens on the EE KS which came with another box in which I keep my tokens, rulebooks, etc.</p><p>However, the game/company has some amzaing fans that have come up with some amazing ideas, espceially about storage solutions. One good place to start is here: <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm\"><font color=\"#2883de\">www.spiffworld.com/sotm</font></a>.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:36:51.410Z",
