      "name": "Orphanleni",
      "username": "Orphanleni",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/orphanleni/{size}/2421_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-21T15:02:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Everything that currently exists fits if it's unsleeved, not counting tokens which you can keep in a bag. They are hard to remove but the simplest solution for that is to put a ribbon loop around a deck on each side so that that deck can be removed easily. Think about the ribbon they put behind batteries in hard to remove devices.</p>",
