      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I too store all of the cards unsleeved in the EE box. &nbsp;Heroes on the left, villains and environments on the right. &nbsp;The hero side is completely snug, so when I want to remove a hero deck, I just gently pull up on the two divider cards on either side of it, and the deck just lifts up with the dividers. &nbsp;Once the first deck is removed, there&#39;s enough leeway to reach my fingers in and directly grab any other deck.</p><p>I keep my oversized villain cards and the tokens in the Shattered Timelines box. &nbsp;Not the most elegant solution, but it works.</p>",
